      "body": "Heat the sugar in a heavy saucepan over medium, stirring constantly. It will clump, then melt into a thick amber liquid (≈<span class=\"rc-nw\">340 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(171 °C)</span></span>). Don’t let it smoke."
